{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_4", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_4.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "And you have still got exercises to correct, I see.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "A whole heap, yes.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "You are pretty full up with work too, it seems to me.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes\u2014but that is good.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "One is so delightfully tired after it.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you like that?", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, because one sleeps so well then.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "You must be dreadfully wicked, Petra.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Wicked?", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, because you work so much.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Mr. Rorlund says work is a punishment for our sins.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Ejlif.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Pooh, what a duffer, you are, to believe a thing like that!", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Come, come, Ejlif!", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing (laughing).", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "That's capital!", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Don't you want to work as hard as that, Morten?", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "No, indeed I don't.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "What do you want to be, then?", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "I should like best to be a Viking,", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Ejlif.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "You would have to be a pagan then.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, I could become a pagan, couldn't I?", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "I agree with you, Morten!", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "My sentiments, exactly.", "para": 18, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (signalling to him).", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "I am sure that is not true, Mr. Billing.", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I swear it is!", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "I am a pagan, and I am proud of it.", "para": 20, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Believe me, before long we shall all be pagans.", "para": 20, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "And then shall be allowed to do anything we like?", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, you'll see, Morten.", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "You must go to your room now, boys; I am sure you have some lessons to learn for tomorrow.", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Ejlif.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "I should like so much to stay a little longer\u2014", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "No, no; away you go, both of you, (The boys say good night and go into the room on the left.)", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you really think it can do the boys any harm to hear such things?", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "I don't know; but I don't like it.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "But you know, mother, I think you really are wrong about it.", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Maybe, but I don't like it\u2014not in our own home.", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "There is so much falsehood both at home and at school.", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "At home one must not speak, and at school we have to stand and tell lies to the children.", "para": 30, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Tell lies?", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, don't you suppose we have to teach them all sorts of things that we don't believe?", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "That is perfectly true.", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "If only I had the means, I would start a school of my own; and it would be conducted on very different lines.", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, bother the means\u2014!", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Well if you are thinking of that, Miss Stockmann, I shall be delighted to provide you with a schoolroom.", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "The great big old house my father left me is standing almost empty; there is an immense dining-room downstairs\u2014", "para": 36, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra (laughing).", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "Thank you very much; but I am afraid nothing will come of it.", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "No, Miss Petra is much more likely to take to journalism, I expect.", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "By the way, have you had time to do anything with that English story you promised to translate for us?", "para": 38, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "No, not yet, but you shall have it in good time.", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "(DR. STOCKMANN comes in from his room with an open letter in his hand.)", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (waving the letter).", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, now the town will have something new to talk about, I can tell you!", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Something new?", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "What is this?", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "A great discovery, Katherine.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}]}